---
// Crimson Pro posters: a book jacket, the ampersand, a reading-room rule.
---
<figure class="pw-p" id="crimson-pro-jacket" data-name="Book jacket">
  <div class="pw-art cp-pa">
    <p class="cp-pa__a">Marguerite Vane</p>
    <p class="cp-pa__t">The<br /><em>Lighthouse</em><br />Keeper’s<br />Daughter</p>
    <p class="cp-pa__q">“Luminous. I read it in a single night.”</p>
    <p class="cp-pa__f">A novel</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="crimson-pro-ampersand" data-name="Ampersand">
  <div class="pw-art cp-pb">
    <p class="cp-pb__amp">&amp;</p>
    <p class="cp-pb__f">Crimson Pro Italic · weight 200 → 900</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="crimson-pro-silence" data-name="Silence">
  <div class="pw-art cp-pc">
    <p class="cp-pc__h">Silence<br /><em>is requested</em></p>
    <p class="cp-pc__b">in the reading room, so that every reader may hear only the voice on the page in front of them.</p>
    <p class="cp-pc__f">The Library · Est. 1854</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<style>
  .cp-pa { background: #1d3b4f; color: #f6f1e7; font-family: 'Crimson Pro Variable', serif; padding: 9cqi 8cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: inset 2.4cqi 0 0 #142a39; }
  .cp-pa__a { font-size: 4.2cqi; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 500; color: #e8c780; }
  .cp-pa__t { margin-top: 8cqi; font-size: 14cqi; line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 300; }
  .cp-pa__t em { font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 800; color: #e8c780; }
  .cp-pa__q { margin-top: auto; font-size: 4.4cqi; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.3; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 400; max-width: 56cqi; }
  .cp-pa__f { margin-top: 3cqi; font-size: 3.2cqi; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.6; }
  .cp-pb { background: #f6f1e7; color: #a34a2a; font-family: 'Crimson Pro Variable', serif; }
  .cp-pb__amp { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 46%; translate: -50% -50%; font-size: 112cqi; line-height: 1; font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 900; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #241d16, #a34a2a); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
  .cp-pb__f { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 7cqi; text-align: center; font-size: 3cqi; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #241d16; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 500; }
  .cp-pc { background: #a34a2a; color: #f6f1e7; font-family: 'Crimson Pro Variable', serif; padding: 12cqi 9cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; align-items: center; }
  .cp-pc__h { font-size: 20cqi; line-height: 0.88; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 200; }
  .cp-pc__h em { font-style: italic; font-size: 0.55em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 500; }
  .cp-pc__b { margin-top: 10cqi; font-size: 5.6cqi; line-height: 1.4; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 400; }
  .cp-pc__f { margin-top: auto; font-size: 3cqi; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 600; }
</style>
